---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

// EcosystemGallerySection — Showcase real PITCAR workshop ecosystem with brand colors
---

<section class="section-padding bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden" aria-label="Ekosistem Bengkel Pitcar">
  <div class="container-custom relative z-10">
    <div class="headline-container">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-600/10 text-brand-300 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-brand-600/20 mb-5">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
        Lingkungan Belajar Nyata
      </span>
      <h2 class="heading-primary text-white mb-5">
        Belajar Langsung dari <span class="text-brand-300 italic">Ekosistem PITCAR</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Suasana kerja, standar penanganan kendaraan pelanggan, peralatan modern, dan bimbingan trainer aktif di bengkel PITCAR.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Gallery Layout: 2 Columns -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Card 1 & 2 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group shadow-lg">
          <div class="relative aspect-16/10 overflow-hidden">
            <Image src="/1.webp" alt="Trainer aktif mendampingi peserta" width={800} height={500} class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"/>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-brand-600 text-white font-bold text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-md">Aktivitas Trainer</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5">
            <h3 class="font-extrabold text-white text-base mb-1">Bimbingan Instruktur Berpengalaman</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Instruktur praktisi yang menangani ribuan unit kendaraan pelanggan setiap bulannya.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group shadow-lg">
          <div class="relative aspect-16/10 overflow-hidden">
            <Image src="/2.webp" alt="Mekanik bekerja dengan standar SOP" width={800} height={500} class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"/>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-md">Mekanik Bekerja</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5">
            <h3 class="font-extrabold text-white text-base mb-1">Standar Operasional Bengkel</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Menerapkan disiplin K3, kebersihan area kerja, dan ketelitian penanganan mesin.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Card 3 Full Height -->
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group shadow-lg flex flex-col h-full">
          <div class="relative flex-1 min-h-[300px] lg:min-h-0 overflow-hidden">
            <Image src="/3.webp" alt="Suasana ritme pekerjaan bengkel PITCAR" width={800} height={1000} class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"/>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-slate-950/20 to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-brand-800 text-white font-bold text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-md">Ritme Bengkel</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 mt-auto">
            <h3 class="font-extrabold text-white text-base mb-1">Pengalaman Ritme Nyata</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Merasakan langsung bagaimana menangani keluhan kendaraan dalam situasi operasional harian.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Subtext note -->
    <p class="text-center text-xs text-slate-400 mt-8">
      📷 Dokumentasi kegiatan operasional & praktik di jaringan bengkel PITCAR.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
